    <briefdescription>
<para>Garman-Kohlhagen (1983) stochastic process. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class describes the stochastic process for an exchange rate given by <formula id="331">\[ dS(t, S) = (r(t) - r_f(t) - \frac{\sigma(t, S)^2}{2}) dt + \sigma dW_t. \]</formula> </para>    </detaileddescription>
